	(text "- There are 2 grounds for this PCB. One is for the signal and the other is for the power.\n- The signal ground is for all the communication and the 5V power.\n- The power ground is only to power the motor (So for the 48V)\n- This is to avoid current going through IMUs or other components\n	by passing through the communication wires in case anything goes wrong\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.954 119.126 0)
